QUERY NAME: qrySumProjectTests
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW tblTestRequ.JobCode, Sum([volume]*[testprice]) AS Cost
FROM MonthlyOutput INNER JOIN tblTestRequ ON (MonthlyOutput.TestCode = tblTestRequ.TestCode) AND (MonthlyOutput.Buyer = tblTestRequ.JobCode)
GROUP BY tblTestRequ.JobCode;

